  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Public API is frozen until next major version.\n      - FFT and spectrum analysis, peak detection, power spectrum, PSD, and Welch PSD.\n      - FIR / IIR filters: LowPass, HighPass, BandPass, BandStop (Butterworth, Bessel, Chebyshev I/II, Elliptic design) via NWaves 64-bit filtering.\n      - Savitzky-Golay denoise filter and Hilbert-transform envelope.\n      - Wavelet transforms (Haar, Daubechies, Coiflet, Symlet) and wavelet threshold denoising.\n      - Full XML documentation on the public API.",
